From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiautomationcore: text pattern and text range client exports (3513)

uiautomationcore: text pattern and text range client exports

TextPattern_get_DocumentRange, _get_SupportedTextSelection, _GetSelection, _GetVisibleRanges,
_RangeFromChild, _RangeFromPoint, all the TextRange_* calls, UiaTextRangeRelease, UiaHTextRangeFromVariant
and UiaHPatternObjectFromVariant. A text range handle remembers the node and provider that made it and a
number; the ITextRangeProvider itself stays on the provider side in a table (uia_text.c), so ranges work
across processes through IWineUiaProvider::call_pattern. Releasing the handle drops the provider's range.
Arrays of ranges and children come back as arrays of variants holding handles. Nodes cross as marshalled
references; uia_node_get_elprov follows one back to the raw provider for RangeFromChild.
